In this folder, you can find the following folders: 

- IOS: 
* APN: In order to use Push Notifications within Apple, upload your APN file here. 

- Intake: Upload a completed intake form so that the environments can be set up in a structured way. 

- MS AppCenter: 
* Apple Appstore Connect Key: To connect AppCenter to Appstore Connect, Upload your AppStore Connect Key here. 
* Google Play Store: To connect to Appcenter to Google Play Console, Upload your Google Play keys here. 
